# Credentials -- never commit. This repository is PUBLIC.
# The worktree branch already ignores these; main did not, and the V1 live
# files here need the same Supabase credentials, so a .env appearing on this
# branch later would otherwise be published. See the 2026-09-03 security audit
# (kept in the private newscraper.ai repo, since it documents an open finding).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
